Shared: `.cursor/extracts/` — `spec-incremental-blocks.md`, `grill-docs-roles.md`, `common-delete-flow.md`, `common-breadcrumb-flow.md`, `grill-tech-debt.md`, `portal-codegen-readiness.md` when relevant.

## Pipeline

1. **`/legacy-spec` or `/spec`** — design v1 `*.spec.yaml` + testcase round 1 (`docs/templates/design-spec.yaml`). Incremental `ui.blocks`. No `codegen`.
2. **`/bqa-grill-docs`** — UI, acceptance, breadcrumb, delete rules.
3. **`/dev-grill-docs`** — portal-gen-ready spec (`docs/templates/spec.yaml`) + `tags`. Gate: `pnpm portal:gen:dry --spec <file>`.
4. **`/grill-with-docs`** — optional reconcile when BQA↔Dev contradict.
5. **`/update-spec`** / **`/update-spec-legacy`** — controlled delta + `#update:*` (not full rewrite).
6. **`/prototype`** — only after dev grill dry-run passes.

- Render: `pnpm docs:render`
- **Không** prototype UI, backend, real API, full E2E/unit trong phase spec/grill.
